
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://bobfortner.com/">Bob Fortner</a> sent along a useful Apple Notes tip: iOS 27 puts a Share a Link option right in the share sheet.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Open an unlocked iCloud note, tap Share, then look under the note&#8217;s title for Share a Link. Apple <a href="https://support.apple.com/en-ca/102462">documents the same route for iPhone and iPad</a>.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="760" height="1020" src="https://www.macsparky.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Apple-Notes-Share-a-Link.png" alt="Apple Notes share sheet showing Share a Link and Copy Link." class="wp-image-21693" srcset="https://www.macsparky.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Apple-Notes-Share-a-Link.png 760w, https://www.macsparky.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Apple-Notes-Share-a-Link-224x300.png 224w, https://www.macsparky.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Apple-Notes-Share-a-Link-500x671.png 500w, https://www.macsparky.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Apple-Notes-Share-a-Link-150x201.png 150w, https://www.macsparky.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Apple-Notes-Share-a-Link-400x537.png 400w, https://www.macsparky.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Apple-Notes-Share-a-Link-200x268.png 200w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Screenshot: <a href="https://support.apple.com/en-ca/102462">Apple</a>.</figcaption></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Document links are so handy, and Apple seems allergic to them. A link can put your project notes within reach of the task that needs them, instead of sending you back to search through Notes.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">This is great, but it is also just a collaboration link. Check who can open the note and whether they can edit it before passing the link along.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">There&#8217;s more work to be done here, Apple.</p>
